    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45196" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋστρεφής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρέφω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-twisted</i>, of a bow-string, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋστρεφέα νευρήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.463
				</span></i>
			; of a lyre-string, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋστρεφὲς ἔντερον οἰός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.408
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεῖσμα ἐϋ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				10.167
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλῳ ἐϋστρεφέϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.346
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋστρεφέεσσι λύγοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.427
				</span></i>
			; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔστροφος</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>shapely</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simm.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.).</div>
